\newlabel{tab:phase5-headline}{{7}{22}{Rush-vs-off-peak headline configurations on Xuancheng. Fitted columns report \code {features=none}/\code {features=real}; recovery diagnostics are Pearson and median cosine on \texttt {[all branching]} states}{table.caption.20}{}}
